<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/cursor') %>
  <%- include('partials/nav') %>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="story-hero">
    <div class="story-hero-img-wrap">
      <img src="/images/Glasgow night xmas markets-3.jpeg" alt="Braxton Studios Enters Techscaler" class="story-hero-img" style="opacity: 0.7;">
      <div class="story-hero-overlay"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="story-hero-content reveal">
      <span class="story-hero-category">Business</span>
      <h1 class="story-hero-title">Braxton Studios Enters Techscaler's Early Stage Programme</h1>
      <span class="story-hero-date">March 27, 2026</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Article -->
  <section class="story-body">
    <div class="story-body-inner reveal">
      <p>Braxton Studios has been accepted into Techscaler, Scotland's national tech scaling programme, delivered by <a href="https://thisiscodebase.com/" target="_blank" class="story-link">CodeBase</a> based in Edinburgh. As part of the early stage support cohort, the studio is focused on proving that its model addresses a genuine need in the market and achieving problem-solution fit with the products and services it offers to creators and brands.</p>

      <p>Through Techscaler, Braxton Studios is being supported through customer discovery, product development, market testing, and investment readiness. The programme provides structured mentoring and strategic guidance designed to help early stage companies build with confidence and scale with clarity.</p>

      <div class="story-inline-img">
        <img src="/images/pexels-cottonbro-6804612.jpg" alt="Braxton Studios at Techscaler">
      </div>

      <p>For Braxton Studios, this represents the next step in a deliberate journey from creative studio to scalable business. With a growing roster of clients across YouTube production, podcasting, and artist campaigns, the challenge now is building the infrastructure and commercial model to match the ambition.</p>

      <p>Being part of Techscaler's ecosystem also opens doors to a wider network of founders, investors, and advisors across Scotland's tech landscape, an environment that encourages bold thinking and disciplined execution in equal measure.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%- include('partials/signup') %>
  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
  <%- include('partials/scripts') %>
</body>
</html>
